## Key AGI Behaviors Now Active

| Behavior | Description |
|----------|-------------|
| **Self-Awareness** | Can report mood, goals, recent experiences via `get_introspection()` |
| **Self-Correction** | Detects low performance and adjusts approach automatically |
| **Autonomous Goals** | Generates objectives from opportunities without human input |
| **Learning to Learn** | Optimizes learning strategies based on historical effectiveness |
| **Behavioral Adaptation** | Changes how it communicates based on past outcomes |
| **Pattern Recognition** | Identifies trends in content performance and user behavior |

