## Usage

```python
# Start periodic self-reflection
await agi_kernel.start_periodic_reflection(interval_minutes=30)

# Get current mental state
introspection = agi_kernel.get_introspection()

# Trigger immediate reflection
reflection = agi_kernel.reflect_now(depth=2)

# Get reflection summary
summary = agi_kernel.get_reflection_summary(n=3)
```
